WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:01.930
Look!

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:07.190
I'm a vampire, too!

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:10.810
<i>When I woke up that evening, 
Akari had become a vampire.</i>

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.290
What do you think?

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.030
What do you mean?!

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.220
Did Ellie do this to you?

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.570
This is going to change everything!

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:22.060
Your school and... What will 
we say to your parents?!

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.380
Oh, this is just a Halloween costume.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.030
I didn't actually become one.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.550
The makeup and fangs are 
pretty realistic, huh?

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.900
Oh...

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.200
That scared me.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.280
Speaking of, if I asked you or Ellie-chan,

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.520
would you make me into a real vampire?

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.580
That will never be an option, 
so just forget about it!

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:16.490
<b>Episode 10</b>

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:16.490
<b>The Vampire and the End of the Year</b>

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:21.840
Halloween's right around the corner, 
so I thought we should plan something.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.440
How about we throw a Halloween party?

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.960
Sure, that sounds fine.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.240
Yay!

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.450
Then I'll go ahead and invite the gang.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:34.220
And I'll make some sweets, and a meal...

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:37.530
I wonder if everyone has a costume.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:39.930
If they don't, I could make something.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:45.480
I think you would look so 
cute in a pumpkin dress.

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:49.430
I could put a lot of frills on it. 
It would look so poofy and cute!

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:54.890
I just ordered something online.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:58.510
Hey! How could you do that?!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:03:02.950
<b>Sob</b>

00:02:58.510 --> 00:02:59.300
Huh?

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:02.940
I didn't want to burden you with more work.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:05.410
<b>Halloween Day</b>

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:07.650
Thanks for inviting us over!

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:09.220
Come on in!

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:11.350
You've all got so much stuff.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:12.120
Yeah.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.790
So where should we change?

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.120
Use my room.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.500
Got it!

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:19.350
Morning...

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:21.210
Is everyone already here?

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:22.700
Morning!

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.150
Hinata-chan and the others 
are changing right now.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:28.460
Oh, wow! You're a witch!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.220
So cute!

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:39.210
But it would have fit you so much 
better if I had made the costume.

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:40.520
You're still stuck on that?

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.930
Listen to this, Sophie-chan!

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:47.370
Everyone ended up getting their own costumes,

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:51.280
and Hinata-chan was the only 
one who let me make her one!

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:54.100
But it would've been hard to 
make costumes for everyone.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:57.340
Sophie-chan, you're up!

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:58.670
And you're a little witch!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.250
Good morning, Sophie-san.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:02.580
Wait, you're both...

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.150
Ta-da!

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:06.480
We're Gothic zombies!

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.060
You're in matching costumes!

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:11.510
I hadn't thought of that!
I'll remember it for next time.

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:14.020
For all your sobbing,
you seem to be having fun.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.740
Wouldn't it have been 
easier to change at home?

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.870
Then you wouldn't have to bring so much stuff.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.760
That is true...

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.860
But it'd be kind of embarrassing 
to walk around like this.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:28.250
Yeah, you could run into your neighbors.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:32.170
But it's Halloween, so there's 
nothing to be self-conscious about.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:34.930
And it's not like it's cosplay for a con.

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.120
She's right!

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:37.570
Still...

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:38.700
That's right.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.770
Did you come over here in that?

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:47.970
I did!

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.660
<i>You</i> need to be more self-conscious.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.420
About what?

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:53.130
I'm done!

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.570
Here comes the wolfman!

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:58.360
Or should I say wolfwoman?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.090
You look great!

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.370
It's so fluffy and cute!

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:05.080
A wolfman sounds like it'd be stinky, though.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.070
Hey! Don't say that!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.280
Well, it's an animal all covered in hair.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:12.240
My dog Mikan is an animal, 
but she smells good!

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.110
And it sounds unhygienic.

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:15.490
How dare you?!

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:20.590
So it's true that vampires 
and werewolves are rivals!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.170
Just like in the movies!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.510
We should stop them!

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:28.110
Ellie-san, my name is Yuu.

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:31.630
We briefly met at the cultural festival, 
but I doubt you remember me.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:34.940
Oh, I remember you.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.900
I never forget a cute girl.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.690
Me, a c-cute girl?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.680
But I'm not...

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:44.490
Oh, you're blushing.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:45.930
See? You're so cute.

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:50.420
Yuu's mine! Seducing her is forbidden!

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:52.030
Oh, my!

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.660
I made some sweets!

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:58.050
Wow, these are great, Akari-san!

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:00.190
I brought some candy and chocolate.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:02.860
Trick or treat!

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.140
Go ahead.

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:07.680
I don't want any treats,
 so I get to play a trick, right?

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:15.630
If you don't give me treats, 
I'll play a trick on you!

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.540
I'll go buy some candy.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:18.270
Hey!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.610
<b>Crushed</b>

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.620
But you don't need to go out of 
your way to get candy! Wait!

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:26.570
Oh, no! I have no candy, so she'll 
play a trick on me now.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.070
That kind of tickles.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.310
All done!

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:34.400
Oh, no, I've been pranked!

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.670
I'm back.

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.160
I got some candy.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.480
Great!

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.630
Trick or treat!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.130
Yay! Candy from Sophie-chan!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.170
But I'm still going to play a trick!

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:50.630
Hey, that's not how it works!

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.250
All that goofing around made me hungry.

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:18.120
Candy alone isn't very filling.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.970
Yeah, that's true.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.330
I guess it's time for dinner, then.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.620
I made Halloween-themed food.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:27.930
Look, I made fingers out of wieners.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.490
They look pretty real, huh?

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.130
You can eat them with ketchup.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.360
And I made some man-shaped bread,

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:37.390
and for dessert, rice flour eyeball 
dumplings with strawberry sauce.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.720
Wow! All of these are perfect for zombies!

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.020
Everyone eat up!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.740
Let's eat!

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:45.280
Let's eat...

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.590
This arm's really tasty!

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:50.940
The head is, too.

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.090
Oh, dear...

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.200
It's like we're all monster friends.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.650
This is fun!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.710
<i>Scary...</i>

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.180
Today was really fun.

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:03.660
Thanks for inviting us.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:07.030
It's too bad high school students 
have to be home so early.

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:08.620
I wanted to hang out more.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:11.250
Well, then, let's all hang 
out together again soon.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.590
Agreed.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.420
Thanks for having us!

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:15.630
Bye!

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:16.550
See you!

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.330
Sophie-chan, let's go inside.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.250
You're so cold!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.440
Really?

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:27.680
Your hands are really ho—warm.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:30.490
What's wrong?

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.250
Nothing!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:34.200
Where'd Ellie-chan go?

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:36.800
Take care!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:37.830
You, too!

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.270
I'm worried about you being alone.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:45.510
I'll walk you home.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:47.340
Huh? Dressed like that?!

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:50.110
What would you do if you 
ran into some weirdo?

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:52.810
<i>Isn't that what you are?</i>

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:54.550
Thanks, though.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:59.020
Hurry up, or I'll leave you here.

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:02.020
I thought you were walking me home.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.540
Vampires are whimsical.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:05.730
Huh...

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:07.770
<i>Now, watch closely.</i>

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:12.020
<i>The tree that has been set up in this 
location is about to be lit up.</i>

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.670
<i>So pretty!</i>

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:18.440
<i>As you can hear,
everyone here is very excited.</i>

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:21.530
<i>We warmly invite all our 
viewers to come by, as well.</i>

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.160
It's already that time of year, huh?

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:27.390
We should all celebrate 
Christmas together, too!

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:29.170
I'll invite Hinata-chan!

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.860
Oh, we get to have another party?

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.410
That's great. Let's do it!

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:37.030
There's a lot of fun stuff to look 
forward to at the end of the year.

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.510
What do you think, Sophie-chan?

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.260
Sounds good to me.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:43.070
So what does one do for Christmas?

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:43.880
Huh?

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.440
I mean, I was asleep for a long time,

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:50.820
so I don't know what people 
these days do for Christmas.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:54.380
I get together with my family and friends,

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:56.860
<b>Christmas Eve at the Amano Household</b>

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:56.870
and we eat cake and all 
kinds of other delicious things.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.720
Everyone celebrates it a little differently.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.850
Some people go out to a restaurant.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:03.640
Some people go on a trip.

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:04.830
What do you do, Sophie-chan?

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:07.820
Hmm, I remember spending 
last year's Christmas

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:16.050
<b>1 Year Ago</b>

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:12.980
browsing Christmas illustrations on Pixiv.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:16.040
That's quite a... modest way to spend it.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.080
I've got an idea!

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:20.690
We should all exchange presents that day!

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:23.810
The contents will be secret, 
and we'll draw to see who gets what!

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:26.420
Hmm, presents?

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:28.390
Picking out presents seems like it'd be hard.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:29.820
That's not true!

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:33.900
If it was me, I'd like to 
get you as my present.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.810
Just kidding.

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:40.200
That means I have a one-in-three 
chance of getting her myself, then.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.530
Never mind, we're not doing that!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.780
Christmas presents, huh?

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:53.540
Yeah. I was wondering if you could give 
me some hints about what I should get.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:57.670
The idea is to get something that 
will make the recipient happy.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.330
Something that makes humans happy...

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:02.320
Money? Or rice?

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.900
Or maybe salt?

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:07.360
None of those would make 
good Christmas presents.

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.670
Not to mention, if I end 
up with your present,

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.620
human food will be the last thing I need.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.560
Salt is even poisonous to us.

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.480
Now that you mention it...

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:17.790
<i>Personally...</i>

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:21.530
I like handmade gifts. 
They have a certain warmth to them.

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.570
Like a muffler handmade by Akari...

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:25.910
Here you go, Hinata-chan!

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:29.500
<i>Handmade gifts, huh?</i>

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.100
Then why don't we make some money?

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.710
That's a felony!

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.930
This really is hard.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:39.870
Want to look at some online 
catalogs with me?

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:42.840
Maybe we'll find the perfect thing.

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.370
They really do have everything.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.060
This looks good.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.520
Thong • Red

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:51.040
Akari's too young to wear 
something like that!

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:51.900
Vetoed!

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:55.220
But she's at that age where 
she'll want to look older.

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:57.690
Good morning.

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:00.160
I'm looking forward to Christmas.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:03.110
Let's invite Sakuya-chan and Yuu-chan, too.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:05.170
Perfect timing!

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:06.580
My plans for Christmas?

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.920
I don't have anything planned yet.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:11.330
How about celebrating at my place again?

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.540
Sounds great!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.050
With Asahi-chan, too!

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:19.280
I guess she's doing a party with 
her friends from school this year.

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:23.420
My parents are going out, too, 
so it might be kind of lonely.

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:26.830
O-Oh, really?

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:30.880
<i>You mean this Christmas, 
it'll be just the two of us?</i>

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:32.760
Hey, would you two—

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:34.350
No, let's leave them alone.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:37.970
Oh, morning, you two. 
Were you about to say something?

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:40.270
Nothing! Nothing at all.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.400
<b>Christmas Day</b>

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:52.030
A present that would make Akari happy...

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:55.870
Wait, are vampires even allowed 
to celebrate Christmas?

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.570
I guess it's okay.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:03.920
<b>Books

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:03.910
Why don't I just pick something I like?

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.380
<b>Supermarket</b>

00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:08.340
What kind of cake are you going to bake?

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:11.700
I think I'd like to put strawberries on it.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:13.930
Look, they've got chocolate Santas!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.400
Let's get some of these, too!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:18.650
<b>Merry X'mas
Chocolate</b>

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.820
This is going to be so fun.

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:19.520
Christmas is all about the cake.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:21.880
Yeah...

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:26.240
I wish Sophie-chan and 
Ellie-chan could eat it, too.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:30.690
We can't do anything about that.
Vampires only consume blood.

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:35.170
Hey, that's it! What if I made a 
sponge cake soaked in blood?!

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.550
Akari, please don't.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.080
How is it over there?

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.490
Almost there.

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:44.960
I hope Sophie-chan and Ellie-chan like it.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.430
It's done!

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:53.000
Maybe we should turn off 
the heat on the pot?

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.550
You look busy.

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:56.820
Let me help.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.250
Good morning, Sophie-chan!

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:01.270
Okay, I'll put you in charge of the pot.

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.690
The soup looks really hot.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:09.810
Above 44 degrees Celsius,
humans run the risk of being burned.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.660
<b>Ice</b>

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.660
Let's add some ice.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:15.260
S-Sophie-chan, why don't you 
just sit down and relax?

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:17.290
Yeah, maybe you can watch some anime?

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.290
<i>They gently kicked me out.</i>

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.510
Merry Christmas!

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:24.940
This cake is so cute!

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:26.700
The other food looks fancy, too.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:29.000
Even if we can't eat it.

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:31.680
The two of you wait just one minute.

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:32.940
Ta-da!

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:36.250
I tried making a cake for you, too!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.770
Well, actually, I just put some of the blood

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.280
from the fridge into a form and froze it.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.230
That looks great!

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.930
Wow, it really does look like a cake.

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.260
You're so clever, Akari!

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:51.330
I'm so glad you both like it!

00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:55.360
How are we supposed to eat this, though?

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.820
I guess we just have to wait until it melts.

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:02.120
I'm sorry. I didn't think that far ahead.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:06.310
All right, everyone draw one ticket.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:10.460
<i>I really hope I get Akari's present.</i>

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.790
I got Sophie-chan's present!

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:14.270
And I got yours.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:15.890
<b><i>Crushed</i></b>

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:17.710
I got Ellie's.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.950
I hope it's not something weird.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:22.190
Hey, that's so rude!

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:27.600
Lipstick! That's very nice,

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:30.150
but I don't think it would look good on me.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.080
Is it even okay for me to have this?

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.260
Hey, no need to be like that.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.900
Give it here. I'll put it on for you.

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:40.810
It looks great. It makes 
me want to devour you.

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:44.030
It doesn't look weird?

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:46.350
You look so grown-up!

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:47.260
So pretty!

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:51.450
<i>This is the first time Akari 
has ever called me pretty.</i>

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:54.520
Thank you! I'll cherish it!

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.050
Are you really crying?

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:59.530
Oh, Sophie-chan's present is a manga.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:59.520
<b>Pay Attention to Me, Octopus!
Kawai Oruka</b>

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:02.400
It's something that's 
recommended for all audiences.

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:03.890
I hope you like it.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:08.100
I'm sure it'll be really great 
if you're recommending it.

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:08.970
I see.

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.430
And your present is...

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:13.390
Oh, gloves?

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:14.100
Yeah.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:17.450
Your hands seemed really 
cold that other time.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.960
These look so warm!

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:23.540
That's it! I'll get these!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.700
I'm really glad you ended up getting them.

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:30.760
I'm grateful for this gift.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.710
And I got this stuffed animal from Hinata.

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:34.720
It's so cute.

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:36.280
You like it?

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:38.320
That makes me really happy.

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:40.990
It's very you to pick something for a kid.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:42.180
<i>But...</i>

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:45.650
<i>If definitely looks right for her.</i>

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:48.630
So everyone got a present, right?

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:49.360
Yeah.

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.330
Yes.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:52.770
Look, it's starting to snow!

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:55.580
Oh, wow, it's a white Christmas!

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:03.250
A snowy Christmas is romantic, 
but it's also cold.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.060
Yeah, it is cold.

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:06.350
Indeed.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.500
I caught some.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.420
You're right, it is cold.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.960
Are you really feeling it? 
You're barely wearing anything!

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:16.940
We vampires aren't negatively 
affected by the cold.

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:19.220
We don't have any body 
heat in the first place.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.680
We also can't die of exposure.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:24.110
Really?

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.090
<i>I see.</i>

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:29.720
<i>If they're fine in the cold, 
she didn't need those gloves.</i>

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:32.910
<i>That might not have been the best present.</i>

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:35.360
<b>A Few Days Later</b>

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.070
<i>Huh?</i>

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:41.780
<i>Sophie-chan's wearing 
gloves inside the house?</i>

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:45.880
These gloves were picked out
by a high school girl.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:49.030
They're so chic! Teenagers do 
have a sense for what's in style.

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:50.620
<i>I'm so glad!</i>

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:53.130
<i>It looks like she likes them after all.</i>

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:57.050
There we go...

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:02.970
They're here!

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:07.600
<i>Today, we're ringing in the 
New Year with Akari and the gang.</i>

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:10.350
<i>We can laze around together.</i>

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.180
Come in, Hinata-chan!

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:14.570
I'm sorry we're late.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:17.850
The big clean-up at my 
house was taking so long.

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.230
That's fine.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:21.190
Ellie-chan came over, too.

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:22.270
Oh, really?

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:27.350
Yeah, but we're not quite done yet.

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:30.010
Oh, how do you do?

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:32.970
<i>Maybe we can't laze around after all...</i>

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:37.240
This is the last of it.

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:38.110
Okay.

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:42.220
It's supposed to get cold 
tonight, so use this.

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.020
Yes! A kotatsu!

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:45.410
Oh, boy!

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:47.110
Wh-What's that?

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:50.310
All right, let's get right in—

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:51.020
Wait!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.190
If you get into it now,
you'll never get out again.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.410
We still need to go shopping!

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:57.800
I'm spending this New Year's Eve 
with Sophie-chan and Ellie-chan.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:18:59.060
I'm so excited!

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:00.650
Um, what about me?

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:03.280
Look at all those cats!

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:08.700
They're so friendly!

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.010
We have warm laps, I guess.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:16.930
I have a free lap, too. Come on.

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:22.930
<b>Crushed</b>

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:19.320
Why?!

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:22.920
Probably because your 
body temperature is low.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.930
These cats have such lovely fur!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:28.170
It would make a very nice fur coat.

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:30.800
Oh, it was just a joke!

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:33.790
I saw a movie like that a 
while ago, except with dogs.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.710
Thank you for waiting!

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:41.370
We have New Year's fries,
strawberry chocolate Pocchy, and chicken.

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.040
Yay!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.690
This is so random.

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:48.120
Don't humans usually eat 
soba on New Year's Eve?

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:50.000
I saw that in an anime.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.990
<i>Let's eat our New Year's soba and 
do our best next year, too!</i>

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:54.120
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:57.080
Akari's allergic to soba.

00:19:57.080 --> 00:20:00.100
So anything long and thin works?

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:03.670
I prepared this "hot sake style"
 for you two.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:07.170
Now all we have to do is lazily 
wait for the New Year to arrive.

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:08.940
I'm looking forward to New Year's Day.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:10.940
What do you do on New Year's Day?

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:14.390
I like to just laze around the house.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:18.620
I binge watch anime or catch up on my reading.

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:22.080
I do the first shrine visit 
of the year with my family,

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:24.960
visit my grandma's house, visit my uncle,

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.750
and then we open our grab bags,

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:29.080
<b>Grab Bag</b>

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:29.070
go to the neighborhood association's
 mochi festival, and...

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:32.220
Young people have so much energy.

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:33.630
They certainly do.

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:35.080
Akari, you're a young person, too!

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.990
The New Year's almost here!

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.010
<b>Excited</b>

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:41.470
You're right!

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:41.470
<b>Antsy</b>

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.980
Happy New Year!

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:46.890
Happy New Year, everyone!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.170
Let's toast.

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:50.760
It's just a new calendar year.

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:52.390
They're sure getting excited.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:57.430
I guess it's only happened a 
handful of times for them.

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:05.160
This kotatsu thing sure makes me sleepy.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:08.060
We didn't get a lot of sleep 
earlier since we were cleaning.

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:09.150
So sleepy...

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:12.280
I'm not going to sleep until I 
see the first sunrise of the year!

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:15.370
The humans and the vampires 
have swapped schedules.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:22.970
Oh, no! I fell asleep!

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:24.800
It's already so late!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:27.920
Hinata-chan, the sun will come up soon!

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:29.760
Really?

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:33.910
It's so cold!

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:43.930
That's so invigorating!

00:21:43.930 --> 00:21:45.810
This is going to be another good year!

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:47.660
It's so beautiful.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:49.520
You're right.

00:21:51.360 --> 00:21:54.110
I'm glad we got to see it in the end.

00:21:54.110 --> 00:21:56.240
I feel like it's cleansing me.

00:21:57.660 --> 00:22:00.300
You two can't look at it! 
When did you even get out here?!

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:05.080
<i>Later, we got to see a video of it.</i>

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:06.480
Oh, my!

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:07.250
Oh...

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:21.000
<b>Episode 11</b>

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:21.000
<b>Cold Season</b>
